{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.three_calibration_inputs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.three_calibration_inputs","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ThreeCalibrationInputs.lean#L48-L67","doc":"**Three-calibration-inputs proposition** (pattern C — named, not\nasserted).\n\nEvery numerical observable of the framework factors through the\nthree calibration inputs `(q₀, m_e, Q_β(n))`: there is a function\n`f : ℝ → ℝ → ℝ → ℝ` of the three calibrations reproducing the\nobservable's value `obs`.  We *name* this factorization claim as a\n`Prop` over an abstract observable `obs : ℝ` — honestly stating the\nconditional conjecture rather than discharging it with a vacuous\n`: True := trivial`.  The framework realises it case-by-case (every\nnumerical comparison cites the calibration block); an inhabitant of\nthis `Prop` for a given `obs` is the per-observable factorization\nwitness.\n\nRef: [leitner2026] `prop:three-calibration-inputs`\n","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:three-calibration-inputs","label":"prop:three-calibration-inputs","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/three-calibration-inputs.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.q_zero_from_ratio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.q_zero_from_ratio","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ThreeCalibrationInputs.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.q_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.q_zero","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ThreeCalibrationInputs.lean#L44-L44","doc":"The substrate parameter is determined by the dimensionless ratio. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.Q_beta_n_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.Q_beta_n_pos","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ThreeCalibrationInputs.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.m_mu_ratio_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.m_mu_ratio_pos","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ThreeCalibrationInputs.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.m_e_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.m_e_pos","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ThreeCalibrationInputs.lean#L40-L40","doc":"All three calibrations are positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.Q_beta_n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.Q_beta_n","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ThreeCalibrationInputs.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.m_mu_over_m_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.m_mu_over_m_e","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ThreeCalibrationInputs.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.m_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.m_e","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ThreeCalibrationInputs.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs.mk","kind":"ctor","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ThreeCalibrationInputs.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ThreeCalibrationInputs","kind":"structure","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ThreeCalibrationInputs.lean#L26-L46","doc":"The three calibration inputs as opaque real-valued constants. Each\nis a CODATA measurement; the framework axiomatises their existence\nand relation to the categorical action.\n\nThe \"axiom\" here is that exactly three real-valued external inputs\nare admissible. Any predicate / observable in the framework must\nfactor through these three plus `q₀`.\n","signatureChunk":0}]}